Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 16:52:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] candidate_seal: enforce completion custody and typed consumer
 fixes [no-triality] [p0-ledger-ok]

# CHECKPOINT_DISCIPLINE_WAIVED:keeper-arm 'ddm_ffi6' landing; resume custody = keeper apparatus (charter + done-receipt + persisted final message), not commit-body checkpoints (auto-appended by the serializer)
